            "author_association": "MEMBER",
            "body": "Thanks for the very detailed issue! It was really helpful to provide the *exact* reproduction steps.\r\n\r\nI did manage to reproduce most of these. For me pressing `<C-Space>` after typing `std::f` also didn't produce LSP suggestions (but fallback instead).\r\n\r\nAt first I thought that this is because of misconfigured triggers completion triggers characters (as in `server_capabilities.completionProvider.triggerCharacters`, but they seem to be fine. And it wouldn't explain LSP completion not appearing after `<C-Space>`.\r\n\r\nCurrently I suspect that this is an issue with LSP server, but I'll take a closer look.",
